Generic single-database configuration for College Uploader migrations.

Commands (run from the project root with the venv active):

    alembic upgrade head          # apply all pending migrations
    alembic downgrade -1          # revert the latest migration
    alembic revision -m "msg"     # create an empty migration
    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "msg"   # diff models -> migration
    alembic current               # show current revision
    alembic history               # list revisions

The database URL is taken from backend/config.py (environment / .env),
never from alembic.ini.
